<title>FINLAND: FIRE AT NESTE REFINERY - AGENCY.</title>
<headline>FIRE AT NESTE REFINERY - AGENCY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A &quot;threatening fire&quot; broke out on Friday at Finnish energy group Neste Oy's refinery at Naantali, southern Finland, the STT news agency said on Friday. </p>
<p>Nobody at Neste was immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
